{"about_the_game":"A cozy strategy roguelite game with good lofi hip hop music.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423780/extras/penguin-general-optimized.gif?t=1712932599\" /><br><br>You are just chilling when a secret door opens to your basement. But there are lots of monsters!<br><br>Take your father's Teleport Sword. Find out where he disappeared long ago.<br>Will you be able to reach the 100th floor and find out the surprising truth?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Turn-based strategy battles<br></li><li> Obtain special abilities, like the Teleport Attack<br></li><li> Infinite replayability + 50 hand-designed levels<br></li><li> Customization:  Buy new skins, outfits and swords<br></li><li> Find out the story about your father's disappearance and the monsters' origin<br></li><li> Good Lofi hip hop music<br></li><li> Ideal to play while listening to something</li></ul><br>Here you can see a penguin chilling and listening to the game's good music:<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423780/extras/penguin_chilling.gif?t=1712932599\" />","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First level","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2423780/8dd30de1bd72aa7b079b24d7b9292a76640b702a.jpg"},{"name":"The basement","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2423780/5e9b301a5d2577014faf252c979afcb09aa9879b.jpg"},{"name":"Old castle in the basement?!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2423780/bc6c6f16074a62152430a8c92f3b5a9ad35144f0.jpg"},{"name":"Underground caves","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2423780/476fbff00e9869e360d9bf1e9af3f1ca86dabe43.jpg"},{"name":"Touched some grass","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2423780